Change notes waiting for a version: one Markdown file per pull request
(for example engine/news.d/welch-default.md), holding the bullets that
will go under the next "# powerkit X.Y.Z" heading of engine/NEWS.md.
scripts/close-batch.R joins them when a batch closes and deletes them.
docs/adding-a-test.md, "Change notes and version numbers", has the rules.
